sequenceDiagram
    %% Atomic 7-Step Registration Transaction Sequence Diagram
    autonumber
    actor Attendee as Attendee
    participant UI as EventDetailsScreen
    participant RegProvider as RegistrationProvider
    participant RegRepo as RegistrationRepository
    participant Firestore as Cloud Firestore Transaction

    Attendee->>UI: Tap "Register Now"
    UI->>RegProvider: registerForEvent(eventId, userId, ...)
    RegProvider->>RegRepo: registerForEvent(...)
    
    activate RegRepo
    RegRepo->>Firestore: runTransaction(transaction)
    activate Firestore
    
    Note over Firestore: Step 1: Read Event document snapshot
    Firestore->>Firestore: Step 2: Validate event.status == 'approved'
    Firestore->>Firestore: Step 3: Check registeredCount < maxParticipants (Capacity Guard)
    Firestore->>Firestore: Step 4: Check existing registrations (Duplicate Spot Guard)
    Firestore->>Firestore: Step 5: Generate unique UUID QR payload "EE:eventId:regId:token"
    Firestore->>Firestore: Step 6: Create RegistrationModel document in /registrations
    Firestore->>Firestore: Step 7: Atomically increment event.registeredCount by +1
    
    Firestore-->>RegRepo: Commit Atomic Transaction Success
    deactivate Firestore
    
    RegRepo->>RegRepo: Trigger in-app confirmation notification
    RegRepo-->>RegProvider: Return new RegistrationModel
    deactivate RegRepo
    
    RegProvider-->>UI: Spot Confirmed State
    UI->>Attendee: Display Confirmed Dialog & Navigate to QRPassScreen
